{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cfV9S5eWp_g2aRD9H1JPPA","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:08.881796+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/cfV9S5eWp_g2aRD9H1JPPA","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>为进一步推进我院博士研究生招生制度改革，完善高层次拔尖创新人才的选拔机制，根据教育部和我校有关文件精神，结合我院实际，决定招收具有推荐免试资格的优秀应届本科毕业生直接攻读博士学位研究生（以下简称“直博生”）。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span> </span></strong></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>一、招生专业</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span>专业代码</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>专业名称</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span>083000</span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span>环境科学与工程</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>二、报名申请对象</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>大陆地区高校优秀本科应届推免生</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>三、报名申请条件</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊、学术不端及其它违法违纪行为。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）纳入国家普通本科招生计划录取的应届毕业生，将获得所在本科学校的推荐免试资格，所学专业为环境科学与工程及相关专业。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（三）学术研究兴趣浓厚，专业素质突出，具有博士</span></span><span><span>生培养潜质，学习成绩优秀，满足下列条件者，可考虑优先录取：</span></span></p><p><span><span>（1）已公开发表与本专业相关的学术论文；</span></span></p><p><span><span>（2）在省级以上的各类科技或创新创业类竞赛中获奖。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（四）身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招生体检工作指导意见》。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（五）符合我校2027年博士研究生招生简章中规定的其他报考条件。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span> </span></strong></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>四、报名和复试安排</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span><span>（一）报名</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>报名时间：2026年8月21日-9月14日</span></span></p><p><span><span>凡符合上述申请条件且有意愿报考我院直博生</span></span><span><span>的全国优秀应届本科毕业生，请在报名时间内注册登录暨南大学研究生招生信息网→推免生报名系统，填写并提交个人申请信息表，报名信息确认提交后，不可修改或撤销。</span></span></p><p><span><span>同时，请于2026年9月14日前，将以下材料汇总成一个PDF发送至邮箱zaoyuezhang@jnu.edu.cn，文件命名为“2027直博生+推免生系统报名号+申请直博专业+姓名+意向博导姓名”：</span></span></p><p><span><span>1.《暨南大学2027年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，预报名系统填报信息后生成申请表，须申请人签名；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.本科阶段综合成绩排名证明（含申请人所在专业同年级人数、本科三年的综合成绩总评名次、排名比例等内容，并加盖学校教务部门公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.外语水平证明，如CET-4、CET-6成绩、雅思、托福、专业英语等成绩；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.有关学术科研成果和获奖证书，如发表论文、出版物或其他原创性工作；</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.不少于3000字的拟攻读博士学位的研究计划书（自行在我校研究生招生信息网下载中心下载模板）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.两封教授（或相当专业技术职称的专家）的书面推荐信，附职称相关证明；</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.政审表（自行在我校研究生招生信息网下载中心下载模板）。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（二）审核</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>9月8日—9月15日，学院将审核并回复考生是否已获得复试资格，考生可在暨南大学研究生招生信息网推免生报名系统中查询审核结果。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（三）复试</span></span></span></p><p><span><span>复试时间：9月17日—19日，各专业具体复试要求及日程安排9月10日后详见暨南大学研究生招生信息网。</span></span></p><p><span><span>直博生选拔工作遵循“德、智、体全面衡量，择优录取，保证质量，宁缺勿滥”的原则，由学位点统一组织进行。复试着重考查申请者外语应用能力、综合运用所学知识的能力、科研创新潜质、对本学科前沿领域及最新研究动态的掌握情况等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>学位点成立考核小组，由不少于7名研究生导师组成。直博生每人面试时间不少于30分钟，采用PPT汇报和口头问答的方式进行。其中，PPT汇报时间不超过15分钟，内容包括个人报考信息、学习经历、社会兼职、个人综合素质能力、个人本科期间学习情况及获奖情况等，本科阶段参与课题情况、取得的成果、科研兴趣、研究生阶段的研究设想等。专家围绕英语应用能力、专业基础、科研综合能力等方面进行提问。</span></span></p><p><span><span>通过直博生选拔考核、成绩合格的推荐免试生，并征得意向博士生导师的同意接收，即获得当年度直博生拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>参加直博生复</span></span><span><span>试的申请者，可同时参加同一专业的推免硕士生复试；未通过直博生选拔考核，但通过推免硕士复试的考生，可获得复试专业的推免硕士生拟录取资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>（四）若教育部推免工作进度安排有调整，相应的报名、审核及复试时间将另行通知。请考生密切关注我校研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span> </span></strong></span></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>五、关于拟录取</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>学校对通过复试并拟录取为我校直博生的推免生发放同意接收函，推免生须按规定时间在中国研究生招生信息网（http://yz.chsi.com.cn/）的推免服务系统完成网上报名确认手续，未在规定时间内完成网上报名确认手续者视为自动放弃，不予录取。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span> </span><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><strong><span><span>六、特别注意</span></span></strong></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></strong></span></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>如申请人提供的材料不真实，一经发现则随时取消录取资格，并予以通报。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span> </span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><span><strong><p><span><span>七、其他说明</span></span></p></strong></span></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><span>（一）直博生学制为5年，入学后适用博士研究生的管理规章制度，履行博士研究生的相关义务。直博生的培养方案、毕业要求及相关管理办法将另行发布。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（二）未能取得学士学位证书和本科毕业证书的考生，以及被取消推荐免试资格者不予录取。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科推免生来我院攻读直博生！</span></strong></span></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section></section><section><section><strong><p><span>END</span></p></strong></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><span>环境与气候学院</span></span></p><p><span><span><span>编辑：董   萍</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>校稿：耿雪松</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>初审：张灶月</span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>复审：李   梅</span></span></span></p></section><p><span><span><span>终审：王雪梅</span></span></span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"0a8b1534d08f14cbbf96fd929b55d8f4a2f48f9eb1c3a14cacec8854191d460b","textLength":1916,"sourceSha256":"3dab3b7e3ba41c2878351da15d2531d3a9c5b04e6ba04ccf388d1a69e28888a9","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-2195fb867856ef8611a1","title":"2026年暨南大学环境与气候学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:08.881796+00:00"}
